&ROULET
			ROULET
			------

	Betting Layout					Types of Bets
	  (* = RED)

	--------------				(1)-(36) signify a straight bet
	 1*   2    3*				     on that number
	 4    5*   6				         pay off is 35:1
	 7*   8    9*				The 2:1 bets are:
	10   11   12*				(37) 1-12	(40) First Col.
	--------------				(38) 13-24	(41) Second Col.
	13   14*  15				(39) 25-36	(42) Third Col.
	16*  17   18*
	19*  20   21*				The even money bets are:
	22   23*  24				(43) 1-18	(46) Odd
	--------------				(44) 19-36	(47) Red
	25*  26   27*				(45) Even	(48) Black
	28   29   30*	
	31   32*  33				(49) 0   and   (50) 00 pay 35:1
	34*  35   36*				but 0 and 00 do not count under
	--------------				any bets except their own

		When asked for a bet, type the number and amount bet, seperated
	by a comma <,> ... minimum bet is $5 ; maximum is $500 

&TICTAC

		TIC TAC TOE
		-----------


	The move positions are:



	     1     2     3
						Computer  =  "X"
	     4     5     6
						You       =  "0"
	     7     8     9




	type a (0) if you want the computer to move first, a (1) if you want to.


&KING

			KING
			----

	Congratulations ... You have become premier of a small (30 by 70 mile)
	communist island. It is your job to decide upon the country's budget
	and to distribute money to your countrymen from the communal treasury.

	The money is in ROLLADS and each person needs 100 rollads per year to
	survive. Your country's income is from farm produce and tourists who
	visit your magnificient forests to hunt and fish.

	Your land is farm land that is also rich in minerals which may be
	sold to foreign interests for strip mining. However, this wreaks the 
	land for farming, and they import their own workers. If you choose to 
	farm the land, it costs between 10 and 15 rallods per square mile to
	plant.

	Your goal is to survive your 8 year term of office   ...  good luck  ! !
